<h2 class="mb-4">

Privacy Policy

</h2>


<p>

At AI Hostel Care, we respect your privacy and are committed
to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy
explains how we collect, use, and protect information when
you use our hostel complaint management platform.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

1. Information We Collect

</h4>


<p>

We collect information provided during registration and
complaint submission, including name, email address, phone
number, hostel details, complaint descriptions, and uploaded
images.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

2. Use of Information

</h4>


<p>

The collected information is used to manage complaints,
track issue progress, improve hostel services, and provide
AI-based complaint analysis such as category detection,
priority identification, and summaries.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

3. AI Processing

</h4>


<p>

AI features are used to analyze complaint details and provide
insights to improve resolution speed. The AI system does not
make final decisions, hostel authorities are responsible for
taking necessary actions.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

4. Data Security

</h4>


<p>

We implement appropriate security measures to protect user
information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

5. Information Sharing

</h4>


<p>

User information is only shared with authorized hostel
management personnel for complaint resolution purposes.
We do not sell or misuse personal information.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

6. User Responsibility

</h4>


<p>

Users are responsible for providing accurate information and
maintaining the confidentiality of their account credentials.

</p>



<h4 class="mt-4">

7. Policy Updates

</h4>


<p>

This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect
changes in our services and security practices.

</p>



